abstract: >-
  Formal proofs of an improved unrestricted lower bound for the gcd quotient-set
  minimum and sharp orders for every fixed prime support. The full unrestricted
  order remains open. This metadata describes the private release candidate;
  publication identifiers and release date are added only at publication.
